    "reviews": "\u201cGreat game for those who don't necessarily need a story. I haven't discovered everything yet, but thumbs up and buy recommendation.\u201d<br>Imelda2102<br><br>\u201cHorse riding sim + quests + racetrack = Explore Pegasus Island on foot, horse, jetpack or pegasus. Build stables and tame horses to help adventure around.\u201d<br>Exodust<br><br>\u201cSo far enjoying the gameplay and the scenery is lovely.\u201d<br>bluegayle<br>",
